     8                          ; authority for source structure, labels, comments, and intent. The
     9                          ; production U22 ROM is the byte oracle. This is not a ROM-byte dump.
    10                          ; OCR source-line anchors are retained in the generator and correction
    11                          ; report, rather than repeated in this readable assembly file.
