  4061  E994  18f3                      JR      MAKE_ERROR
  4062                          
  4063                          
  4064                          FILE_EXISTS:
  4065  E996  3e06                      LD      A,FILE_EXISTS_ERR
  4066  E998  18ef                      JR      MAKE_ERROR
  4067                          
